### Sample requests for the order management system.
### Run them from IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client) or VS Code (REST Client extension).

@orderService = http://localhost:8081
@processingService = http://localhost:8082
@printService = http://localhost:8083

### 1. Create an order -> 202 Accepted
POST {{orderService}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ana Souza",
  "customerEmail": "ana@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "SKU-1", "productName": "Mechanical keyboard", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 150.00 },
    { "productId": "SKU-2", "productName": "Mouse", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 79.90 }
  ]
}

### 2. Invalid fields -> 400 with one error per field
POST {{orderService}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "",
  "customerEmail": "not-an-email",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "SKU-1", "productName": "Keyboard", "quantity": 0, "unitPrice": -1 }
  ]
}

### 3. Business rule: same product twice -> 422
POST {{orderService}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ana Souza",
  "customerEmail": "ana@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "SKU-1", "productName": "Keyboard", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 150.00 },
    { "productId": "SKU-1", "productName": "Keyboard", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 150.00 }
  ]
}

### 4. Business rule: total above 50,000.00 -> 422
POST {{orderService}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ana Souza",
  "customerEmail": "ana@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "SKU-9", "productName": "Server rack", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 9999.99 }
  ]
}

### 5. List orders (newest first, paged)
GET {{processingService}}/orders?page=0&size=20

### 6. List orders filtered by status
GET {{processingService}}/orders?status=CREATED

### 7. Get one order (replace the id with one returned by request 1)
@orderId = replace-with-an-order-id
GET {{processingService}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### 8. Confirm the order -> 200
PATCH {{processingService}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### 9. Transition not allowed by the lifecycle -> 409
PATCH {{processingService}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CREATED" }

### 10. Unknown order -> 404
GET {{processingService}}/orders/does-not-exist

### Actuator: health of each service
GET {{orderService}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{processingService}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{printService}}/actuator/health

### Actuator: info
GET {{processingService}}/actuator/info

### Actuator: business metrics
GET {{orderService}}/actuator/metrics/orders.published

###
GET {{processingService}}/actuator/metrics/orders.stored

###
GET {{printService}}/actuator/metrics/orders.printed
